  "notes": "Generated by xdrcheck-corpus gen from scenarios/s19-protocol-24-upgrade.yaml on a local stellar-core, at Protocol 23 on the testnet and public passphrases (2 variants); the accounts are label-derived and equal across variants, hashes and the fee pool are per variant under derived. The two upgrade ledgers have the same shape and length; only the public-passphrase one carries the adjustment: its fee pool is 41644474 (9765439 + 31879035), the testnet one stays at 9765439. The shared expectation pins the fee pool through each variant's derived.header.fee_pool, and verify checks each variant's derived.header against the header in its blob. Each variant's protocol is the one transactions are applied under (23); the header already shows 24 (header_protocol). No reader has been run against these ledgers yet, so the entry declares no known divergence."
